{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>為了慶祝成立 70 週年，大埔嘉道理農場暨植物園特別推出限時免費入園優惠！由 7 月 15 日至 9 月 14 日期間，不論是成人、小童、長者還是合資格殘疾人士，通通都可以免費入場！大家可參加「喚醒記憶：大帽山的民族植物故事」等特別展覽，園內有各種本土與奇珍植物，絕對是攝影愛好者的天堂！漫步林間小徑時，還有機會邂逅赤麂、猴子或各種珍稀動物，非常適合一家大小來一場生態探索。</p><p>熱愛戶外活動的朋友也絕對不能錯過園內的登山路線！你可以沿著古蹟路徑與特別展覽拾級而上，依著自己的節奏輕鬆漫步，沿途還能俯瞰大帽山一帶壯麗無比的自然景色。</p><p>不過反應太熱烈，暫時報名入場暫停，網站重開後大家可到嘉道理農場網站報名。</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178413131096271030_16438397476a57aeef6e783.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178413131279042986_3349267436a57aef185f66.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17841313155647189_13535308566a57aef425b31.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/17841313176923086_6349114156a57aef6b657d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178413132064755649_4928427196a57aefa10b27.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178413132335821032_5166746046a57aefbb8289.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178413132506991282_2595687516a57aefd6e617.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/178413132677564943_7635140666a57aeff4dead.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T16:20:00.143504+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":376,"images":8,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}